### 10.3 Citation Card Requirements

Per the defensibility framework, every ShiftAssignment must include a citation card. The citation card must contain:

- Result description (who was assigned to what)
- Rule applied (which layer of the decision flow)
- Match score
- Hard constraints passed (list)
- Scoring factor breakdown
- Bias check summary
- Confidence level
- Disclaimer: "AI-assisted recommendation. Assignment subject to clinical manager review and approval per 42 CFR §484 and agency policy. This tool does not make final staffing decisions."

