## Appendix B: Cancellation Classification System

Per the QA/PI Playbook, every cancellation must be classified:

| Source Category | Description |
|----------------|-------------|
| patient_initiated | Patient/family cancels (hospitalization, travel, etc.) |
| caregiver_initiated | Clinician calls in sick, no-show, personal emergency |
| agency_initiated | Scheduling error, reassignment, compliance hold |

**Required Cancellation Fields:**
- `cancellationSource` (required — no "quick cancel" without source)
- `cancellationReason` (required — reason code text)
- `cancellationPreventable` (required — boolean + rationale)

**Key Metrics:**
```
Preventable Cancellation Rate = (Preventable Cancellations / Total Cancellations) × 100
Recovery Rate = (Rescheduled or Replaced Shifts / Total Cancellations) × 100
Visit Delivery Rate = Delivered Hours / Authorized Hours (target: ≥95%)
```

